      "created_at": "2018-07-04T02:54:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Can someone tell me what is included in each of the variant boxes? I'm looking to possibly purchase some, and would like to know which ones are worth buying for what I want/need.</p><p><em>S<em>otM: Complete Hero Variant Collection</em></em></p><p><em>SotM: Ultimate Collector's Case</em></p><p><em>SotM: 5th Anniversary Foil Villain Collection</em></p><p><em>SotM: Promo Cards</em></p>",
