      "raw": "<p>Can someone tell me what is included in each of the variant boxes? I&#39;m looking to possibly purchase some, and would like to know which ones are worth buying for what I want/need.</p><p><em>S<em>otM: Complete Hero Variant Collection</em></em></p><p><em>SotM: Ultimate Collector&#39;s Case</em></p><p><em>SotM: 5th Anniversary Foil Villain Collection</em></p><p><em>SotM: Promo Cards</em></p>",
