      "id": 219575,
      "name": "Basketkeep",
      "username": "Basketkeep",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/basketkeep/{size}/2145_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-07-04T13:47:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you!</p><p>On the SotM: Promo Cards I meant to write SotM: 5<span>th Anniversary Foil Hero Collection.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I do have three more questions:</p><p>Which one is a better deal for the oversize villain cards? 5th Anniversary Foil Villain Collection or the Oversize Villain Cards.</p><p>Which one is a better deal to get promo hero cards? 5<span>th Anniversary Foil Hero Collection or Complete Hero Variant Collection.</span></p><p><span>Is the only way to get a&nbsp;</span><span>Completionist Guise in The Ultimate Collector's Case?</span></p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:51:54.756Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
