      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Thank you!</p><p>On the SotM: Promo Cards I meant to write SotM: 5<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">th Anniversary Foil Hero Collection.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I do have three more questions:</p><p>Which one is a better deal for the oversize villain cards? 5th Anniversary Foil Villain Collection or the Oversize Villain Cards.</p><p>Which one is a better deal to get promo hero cards? 5<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">th Anniversary Foil Hero Collection or Complete Hero Variant Collection.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Is the only way to get a&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Completionist Guise in The Ultimate Collector&#39;s Case?</span></p>",
