      "created_at": "2018-07-04T13:55:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you just care about price, the non-foils will probably be less expensive. I will note that if you go with the non-foil villains The Dreamer will have a typo and I believe one other villain had a typo as well… I forget which. The errors aren’t that big a deal but they do effect gameplay.</p>\n<p>You can get Completionist Guise with the Collector’s Case, the hero variant collection, or with The Foil Hero Collection.</p>",
