      "raw": "[quote=\"Dandolo\"]\n\nIf you just care about price, the non-foils will probably be less expensive. I will note that if you go with the non-foil villains The Dreamer will have a typo and I believe one other villain had a typo as well.... I forget which. The errors aren&#39;t that big a deal but they do effect gameplay.\n\nYou can get Completionist Guise with the Collector&#39;s Case, the hero variant collection, or with The Foil Hero Collection.\n\n[/quote]\n\nIt&#39;s Agent of Gloom Spite, I think.\n\nBack to the lurk.\n",
